# vis kind=daycycle stops="06:30:banhmi:Bánh mì cart|09:00:caphe_phin:Street café|12:00:pho:Lunch|19:00:biahoi:Bia hơi" sub="one day in Vietnam" dur=6
Six thirty. Breakfast.
Nine. Coffee.
Noon. Lunch.
Seven. A cold beer.
# vis kind=hero place=sidewalk time=dawn obj=banhmi name="BÁNH MÌ · CART" price="25.000 ₫" sub="≈ $1" head="BREAKFAST|price checked Oct 2026"
Breakfast first. A bánh mì from a cart.
Twenty-five thousand dong. About one dollar.
# vis kind=build set=banhmi parts="pate:PÂTÉ|pork:GRILLED PORK|pickles:PICKLED CARROT|cucumber:CUCUMBER|herbs:CORIANDER|chili:CHILI|sauce:MAGGI" sub="inside a 25k bánh mì" final="25.000 ₫|all of that for $1"
What's inside that one-dollar bánh mì?
A layer of pâté,
grilled pork,
pickled carrot,
cool cucumber,
coriander,
fresh chili,
and a splash of Maggi.
Close it up. One dollar.
# vis kind=build set=pho bg=ember parts="broth:BROTH|noodles:RICE NOODLES|beef:RARE BEEF|herbs:HERBS|lime:LIME|chili:CHILI" sub="a 45k bowl of phở" final="45.000 ₫|lunch, sorted"
Lunch is phở.
Broth simmered all night,
soft rice noodles,
rare beef that cooks in the bowl,
herbs,
lime,
and chili. Forty-five thousand.
# vis kind=vs place=oldquarter a=caphe_phin an="STREET CAFÉ" pa=20000 b=caphe_suada bn="TOURIST CAFÉ" pb=90000 head="SAME COFFEE" verdict="4.5× MORE|50 metres apart"
A street café pours iced coffee for twenty thousand.
Fifty metres away, the same coffee costs ninety.
Four and a half times more, for a nicer chair.
# vis kind=receipt items="banhmi:Bánh mì:25000|caphe_phin:Cà phê:20000|scooter:GrabBike:30000|pho:Phở:45000|ticket:Museum:40000|biahoi:Bia hơi ×2:20000|buncha:Bún chả:55000|backpack:Dorm bed:200000" final="435.000 ₫|≈ $17 for the whole day"
Bánh mì.
Coffee.
A Grab ride.
Phở.
A museum.
Two beers.
Bún chả.
And a dorm bed.
The whole day: four hundred thirty-five thousand. About seventeen dollars.
# vis kind=bars items="Street price:20000:caphe_phin|Tourist café:90000|Hotel lobby:120000" hi=1 unit=" ₫" head="THE TRAP|same iced coffee"
Street price, twenty thousand.
Tourist café, ninety.
Hotel lobby, a hundred and twenty.
# vis kind=grid items="banhmi:Eat at carts|scooter:Book Grab|caphe_phin:Sit on stools|!caphe_suada:Skip lobby cafés" head="SAVE THIS"
Eat at carts.
Book rides in the app.
Sit where locals sit.
And skip the lobby café.
